{"seq":3,"slug":"direct-mail-linehaul-port","title":"国际直邮干线组织与口岸选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/direct-mail-postal-import-customs/direct-mail-mode/direct-mail-linehaul-port","wordCount":2444,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"国际直邮干线组织与口岸选择\">国际直邮干线组织与口岸选择</h1><p>一个直邮包裹从境外仓库到消费者手里，中间要经过三段物理网络：境外集货与出境、国际干线运输、进口口岸清关与境内派送。前两段决定了包裹能不能按时到口岸，第三段决定了包裹能不能合规出去。口岸选择不是「哪个口岸近选哪个」——它是清关能力、航线密度、监管条件三者的联合优化，且这三个因素会随季节和政策漂移。</p>\n<p>本篇讲这条干线的工程组织：怎样把境外集货点、干线航班/船期、进口口岸、境内派送网络拼成一条可监控、可切换、可路由的链路。通道分类学在 <a href=\"cc-bc-postal-channel\">通道谱系</a>，选型的成本侧在 <a href=\"direct-vs-bonded-tradeoff\">直邮 vs 保税选型</a>，到口岸之后的清关状态在 <a href=\"../direct-clear-status/direct-customs-status-machine\">直邮清关状态机</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-干线的三段结构与交接点\">核心概念：干线的三段结构与交接点</h2><p>直邮链路可以抽象成三个交接点，每个交接点都是一次责任的转移与一次数据的上报。</p>\n<p><strong>出境交接点</strong>在境外集货仓。包裹在这里被扫描、称重、贴国际面单，向境外邮政或承运人交寄。此刻产生的数据是国际段运单号与出境申报数据（邮政渠道下对应 CN22/CN23 报关单，见 <a href=\"../postal-customs-clear/direct-declare-document\">个人物品与电商直购申报要素</a>）。这条交接的规范基础来自万国邮政联盟框架：按 <a href=\"https://www.upu.int/en/Postal-Solutions/Programmes-Services/Postal-Supply-Chain/Customs\">UPU 海关与电子预告数据（EAD）机制</a>，邮政运营方有义务把「发件人、内容物与价值」的信息在发运前通过海关申报系统（CDS）以 EDI 报文交换给海关，而不是仅靠随包纸质单据。这意味着出境交接点本身就是一次数据上报，不只是物理扫描。</p>\n<p><strong>入境交接点</strong>在进口口岸。包裹随航班或船期到达，向海关申报、接受查验、完成清关。这是整条链路上唯一可能被扣货的位置。入境侧的前置数据要求同样在收紧——欧盟的 ICS2 要求所有进入或过境欧盟的货物在到达前提交完整入境摘要报关（ENS），且空运还须在装载前提交最小数据集；自 2026 年 6 月 1 日起，临时性的 NCTS 第六阶段豁免结束，任何运输方式的货物都需要有效的 ENS（见 <a href=\"https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/customs-security/ics2_en\">欧盟委员会 ICS2 官方说明</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>境内交接点</strong>在口岸的转关仓库。清关放行后，包裹转为境内快递面单，进入国内派送网络。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[境外集货仓] --&gt;|国际运单 + 出境申报| B[国际干线]&#10;  B --&gt;|航班/船期| C[进口口岸]&#10;  C --&gt;|清关申报| D{海关处置}&#10;  D --&gt;|放行| E[转关仓]&#10;  E --&gt;|境内面单| F[境内派送]&#10;  D --&gt;|查验/扣货| G[异常处置]&#10;  G --&gt;|补税/退运| C\">graph LR\n  A[境外集货仓] --&gt;|国际运单 + 出境申报| B[国际干线]\n  B --&gt;|航班/船期| C[进口口岸]\n  C --&gt;|清关申报| D{海关处置}\n  D --&gt;|放行| E[转关仓]\n  E --&gt;|境内面单| F[境内派送]\n  D --&gt;|查验/扣货| G[异常处置]\n  G --&gt;|补税/退运| C</pre><p>三段之间的交接点是最容易出数据断点的地方：国际运单号到了境内要换成境内快递号，两个号之间若没有映射关系，消费者就查不到轨迹。工程上必须在入境交接点建立运单号映射表，且这个映射要与申报清单的关联键一致。</p>\n<h3 id=\"交接点的数据契约\">交接点的数据契约</h3><p>每个交接点至少要产出四类字段，缺一类都会导致下游无法关联：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交接点</th>\n<th>必须产出</th>\n<th>用于</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>出境</td>\n<td>国际运单号、重量、件数、申报价值</td>\n<td>干线装载与到港预报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>入境</td>\n<td>申报清单号、监管代码、口岸代码、到港时间</td>\n<td>清关申报与状态机起点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>境内</td>\n<td>境内快递号、国际运单号映射</td>\n<td>轨迹拼接与消费者查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"口岸选择的多目标模型\">口岸选择的多目标模型</h2><p>口岸选择要同时优化三个目标：清关时效、干线成本、监管可行性。三者常常互相冲突。</p>\n<p><strong>清关时效</strong>取决于口岸的海关处理能力与业务量。业务量过大的口岸在旺季会积压，业务量过小的口岸航线稀疏、到港批次少。这个指标不是常数，应当按周滚动统计。</p>\n<p><strong>干线成本</strong>由航线密度决定。航班/船期密集的口岸，单位重量运费低且能拼板；稀疏口岸的包裹要等凑够量才发，时效差。成本与时效在这一项上方向一致——密集口岸两者都优。</p>\n<p><strong>监管可行性</strong>是最容易被忽略的硬约束。不同口岸对某些品类有额外的监管要求（例如特定口岸对含电池产品、化妆品、食品有更严的准入），且不同口岸的通关模式支持度不同（9610 直购、邮路、快件在同一口岸的可用性不一样）。一个成本最优的口岸若不能走你的品类，就直接出局。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>主要决定因素</th>\n<th>是否随时间漂移</th>\n<th>典型冲突</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>清关时效</td>\n<td>口岸处理能力 / 当期业务量</td>\n<td>是（旺季积压）</td>\n<td>与成本反向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干线成本</td>\n<td>航线密度、拼板能力</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>与时效同向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>监管可行性</td>\n<td>品类准入、通关模式支持</td>\n<td>低（政策变化时才变）</td>\n<td>一票否决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派送覆盖</td>\n<td>口岸到消费者的地理距离</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>与干线成本反向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"用加权评分做初筛\">用加权评分做初筛</h3><p>把可量化的目标归一化后加权求和，是工程上可行的初筛方法。设口岸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 在目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 上的归一化得分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则综合分为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i = \\sum_j w_j \\cdot s_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>监管可行性不参与加权——它是可行性过滤器，先筛掉不可行的口岸，再对剩下的排序。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 口岸评分：先过滤不可行，再按加权分排序&#10;SELECT&#10;  p.port_code,&#10;  p.port_name,&#10;  sum(w.weight * p.normalized_score) AS total_score&#10;FROM port_objective_scores p&#10;JOIN port_objective_weights w ON w.objective = p.objective&#10;WHERE p.port_code NOT IN (&#10;  SELECT port_code FROM port_category_restriction&#10;  WHERE category = $1 AND allowed = false&#10;)&#10;  AND p.stat_week = $2&#10;GROUP BY p.port_code, p.port_name&#10;ORDER BY total_score DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 口岸评分：先过滤不可行，再按加权分排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">port_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">port_name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">weight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">normalized_score</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_score</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> port_objective_scores p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> port_objective_weights w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">objective</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">objective</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">port_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> port_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> port_category_restriction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> allowed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">stat_week</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">port_code</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">port_name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"权重不是常数\">权重不是常数</h3><p>权重应当随业务状态调整。旺季时清关时效的权重应当上调——旺季积压会让时效方差急剧扩大，而消费者对延误的容忍度在旺季反而下降（因为多数商品是礼品或节令品）。淡季时可以下调时效权重、上调成本权重。</p>\n<p>权重调整要留痕：每一次权重变更都要记录生效时间段，否则事后无法解释「为什么上个月推荐了这个口岸」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"干线的可切换设计\">干线的可切换设计</h2><p>干线链路必须可切换，因为航班停飞、口岸拥堵、政策调整都会发生。可切换的前提是链路的每一段都是可替换组件，而不是硬编码的路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"把路径建模成可配置的路由\">把路径建模成可配置的路由</h3><p>不要在代码里写死「日本仓 → 上海口岸 → 华东派送」这样的链路。应当把路径表达成一张路由表，履约服务按订单属性（目的国、品类、时效承诺、成本上限）查表选路。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;routeId&quot;: &quot;RT-JP-EC-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;origin&quot;: { &quot;country&quot;: &quot;JP&quot;, &quot;hub&quot;: &quot;OSAKA-1&quot; },&#10;  &quot;legs&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;linehaul&quot;, &quot;carrier&quot;: &quot;LH-JP-CN-A&quot;, &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;air&quot;, &quot;slaHours&quot;: 30 },&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;customs&quot;, &quot;port&quot;: &quot;CN-SHA-EC&quot;, &quot;declarationMode&quot;: &quot;9610&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;lastmile&quot;, &quot;carrier&quot;: &quot;LM-CN-EAST&quot;, &quot;slaHours&quot;: 36 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;allowedCategories&quot;: [&quot;beauty&quot;, &quot;supplement&quot;],&#10;  &quot;restrictedCategories&quot;: [&quot;battery-loose&quot;, &quot;food-fresh&quot;],&#10;  &quot;maxDeclaredValueCny&quot;: 5000,&#10;  &quot;activeFrom&quot;: &quot;2026-09-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;activeTo&quot;: null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"routeId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RT-JP-EC-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"origin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"country\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"hub\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"OSAKA-1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"legs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"linehaul\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"carrier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LH-JP-CN-A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"air\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"slaHours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"port\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN-SHA-EC\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"declarationMode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"9610\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"lastmile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"carrier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"LM-CN-EAST\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"slaHours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">36</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"allowedCategories\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"beauty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"restrictedCategories\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"battery-loose\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"food-fresh\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"maxDeclaredValueCny\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"activeFrom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"activeTo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>路由表里的 <code>declarationMode</code> 必须与通道注册表一致（见 <a href=\"cc-bc-postal-channel\">通道谱系</a>），否则会出现「路由走邮路、申报按 9610」这种非法组合——这类错误在系统里不会立刻报错，直到海关退单才暴露。</p>\n<h3 id=\"降级路径要预先定义\">降级路径要预先定义</h3><p>当主路径不可用时，系统需要一个预定义的降级顺序，而不是让人临时拍板。降级路径同样要在路由表里登记，只是优先级更低。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>降级动作</th>\n<th>不可降级的情形</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>干线航班取消</td>\n<td>切到备选航线（同口岸）</td>\n<td>品类只允许特定承运人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>口岸拥堵超阈值</td>\n<td>切到备选口岸</td>\n<td>备选口岸不支持该品类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申报模式被暂停</td>\n<td>切到邮路或快件</td>\n<td>商品非正面清单内</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>境内派送商故障</td>\n<td>切到备选派送商</td>\n<td>面单已打印且已交接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行值得强调：<strong>面单已交接就无法切换派送商</strong>。这是链路里的不可逆点，与 <a href=\"cc-bc-postal-channel\">通道谱系</a> 中「同订单不可漂移」是同一类边界——数据一旦进入对方系统，本地方的可选项就收敛了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集货与拼板\">集货与拼板</h2><p>直邮的干线成本高度依赖拼板效率。单个小包走空运的单位成本远高于拼板后的成本，因此境外集货仓的核心职能是「凑量」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"集货的时间与成本权衡\">集货的时间与成本权衡</h3><p>集货意味着等待。设集货仓的日均到货量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，一个板位的容量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，则凑满一板平均需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B / \\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 天。这个等待时间直接加到履约时效上，与干线运输时间是可加的两段。</p>\n<p>工程上的做法是设定一个「最大等待时长」<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，到达该时长即使未凑满也发运：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>λ</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{wait} = \\min\\left(\\frac{B}{\\lambda},\\ T_{max}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的取值要参考订单的时效承诺：若承诺 7 日达，干线占 2 日、清关占 1 日、派送占 2 日，则集货最多只能占 2 日。</p>\n<h3 id=\"拼板的品类约束\">拼板的品类约束</h3><p>拼板不是任意混合。含电池、液体、粉末的品类有运输限制，不能与普通品类混在同一板位按普通货运输。集货系统必须知道每个 SKU 的运输属性，并在分板时做约束校验——这与 <a href=\"../direct-mail-ops/direct-mail-risk-compliance\">拆包与化整为零等违规防控</a> 中讨论的合规校验是同一套商品属性数据的两个用途。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>直邮链路抽象为出境、入境、境内三个交接点，每个交接点都是责任转移与数据上报的边界，必须建立运单号映射。</li>\n<li>口岸选择是多目标问题：清关时效、干线成本、监管可行性、派送覆盖；其中监管可行性是一票否决的过滤器，不参与加权。</li>\n<li>口岸评分权重应随业务状态调整（旺季上调时效权重），且权重变更要留痕以支持事后归因。</li>\n<li>干线路径应建模为可配置的路由表而非硬编码链路，<code>declarationMode</code> 必须与通道注册表一致。</li>\n<li>降级路径要预先定义；面单交接与通道申报是不可逆点，触发后本地可选项收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"国际直邮干线组织与口岸选择","id":"国际直邮干线组织与口岸选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：干线的三段结构与交接点","id":"核心概念-干线的三段结构与交接点"},{"level":3,"text":"交接点的数据契约","id":"交接点的数据契约"},{"level":2,"text":"口岸选择的多目标模型","id":"口岸选择的多目标模型"},{"level":3,"text":"用加权评分做初筛","id":"用加权评分做初筛"},{"level":3,"text":"权重不是常数","id":"权重不是常数"},{"level":2,"text":"干线的可切换设计","id":"干线的可切换设计"},{"level":3,"text":"把路径建模成可配置的路由","id":"把路径建模成可配置的路由"},{"level":3,"text":"降级路径要预先定义","id":"降级路径要预先定义"},{"level":2,"text":"集货与拼板","id":"集货与拼板"},{"level":3,"text":"集货的时间与成本权衡","id":"集货的时间与成本权衡"},{"level":3,"text":"拼板的品类约束","id":"拼板的品类约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"直邮与保税备货的选型与成本模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/direct-mail-postal-import-customs/direct-mail-mode/direct-vs-bonded-tradeoff"},"next":{"title":"行邮税与跨境电商综合税的计税口径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/direct-mail-postal-import-customs/postal-customs-clear/personal-articles-vs-ecc-tax"}}